{
  "name": "Day 15 — Telegram AI Assistant (Agent + Tools + Memory)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 15: Telegram AI Assistant (Agent + Tools + Memory)\n\n\n**Setup:**\n- Connect: Telegram bot token (BotFather se)\n- Connect: OpenAI API key\n- Connect: Google Sheets (Google OAuth)\n- Connect: Google Calendar (Google OAuth)\n- \"Expenses\" tab headers: date, amount, category, note\n- Workflow Active karo\n\nCourse: Day 15 lesson page",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a5645c77-e2c8-4ffe-afb9-39e2e773bb94",
      "name": "Setup Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "aea96676-c45d-4691-a2cd-8b53a43b36d7",
      "name": "Telegram Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "eeb31059-5423-4f5f-a353-85cfb982e8b3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.message.text }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=Tum mera personal assistant ho. Aaj ki date: {{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd cccc') }}, timezone Asia/Kolkata.\nRules:\n- Meeting ke liye Calendar tool use karo (default 30 min).\n- Kharche ke liye Expense tool use karo (amount, category, note).\n- Calculation ke liye Calculator tool.\n- Jawab chhota, Hinglish mein, emoji 1 max.\n- Paise bhejne ya delete karne jaisa kaam kabhi mat karo — mana kar do."
        }
      },
      "id": "1329f5ad-a1b5-4a10-a78c-0c1906738014",
      "name": "AI Assistant",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        260,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ea195d05-fce4-4be7-ab0d-deb8fbb9ec0a",
      "name": "OpenAI Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        160,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Telegram Message').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 10
      },
      "id": "1be64780-4665-4789-ab1d-b315c1f132ef",
      "name": "Chat Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        310,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "02d30835-6174-4248-ac08-4db8a6e38df1",
      "name": "Calculator",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolCalculator",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "PASTE_YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Expenses",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "date": "={{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }}",
            "amount": "={{ $fromAI('amount', 'expense amount in INR', 'number') }}",
            "category": "={{ $fromAI('category', 'food, travel, office, other') }}",
            "note": "={{ $fromAI('note', 'short description') }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f1fb3e76-33a2-489d-a4aa-f288ebe01f18",
      "name": "Log Expense",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTool",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        610,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "calendar": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "primary",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "start": "={{ $fromAI('start', 'ISO datetime with +05:30') }}",
        "end": "={{ $fromAI('end', 'ISO datetime with +05:30') }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "summary": "={{ $fromAI('title', 'meeting title') }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "35a097cc-c0ed-4cf5-a6b8-787ae5b745b5",
      "name": "Book Meeting",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendarTool",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        760,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Message').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.output }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "465f023f-3ca4-41ff-ae59-2ff1bea83bbc",
      "name": "Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
